      <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 680px; margin: 0 0 26px;">"Best POS" lists are mostly written for a single shop with a tablet. An enterprise retailer runs dozens to thousands of stores, in several countries, on inventory that has to be right everywhere at once. This page sets out what that actually requires, how the three kinds of POS on the market compare against it, and where this platform sits.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content: flex-start; margin: 0;">
